80845799-3efc-4104-879c-fa8041f0de16","number":"70","volume":"8","title":" The Battle of the Oblivious Begins","lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2026-01-13T13:49:47+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"23bd5d6a-c53e-4d7f-a470-ee7ec8db933c","number":"70","volume":"8","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-12-27T02:50:51+00:00","baked":true}],"chapterCount":232,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T18:46:32.220Z"},"a82fe527-9e74-48d0-9c5f-a5e788c0bd4a":{"id":"a82fe527-9e74-48d0-9c5f-a5e788c0bd4a","title":"Angnyeo neun Marionette","altTitle":"The Villainess Is a Marionette","description":"\"Beauty cannot be real power.\"\n\nCayena, the Imperial Princess, was known as the most beautiful woman in the Empire. She was a woman who knew nothing but evil and luxury. However, she was destined for ruin: she would be used as a chess piece by her younger brother to secure his throne and killed by her crazy husband.\n\n\"I'll make you the emperor.\"\n\n\"…Sister, you're going to make me the emperor?\"\n\n\"In exchange, give me freedom.\"\n\nShe had to change things before she became *that* Cayena.\n\n---\nI woke up as Kayena Hill, the novel’s villainess, praised as the greatest beauty in the empire. Who knew that her story would catch my attention because I was her in my past life? Destined for terrible ends, I’ve died twice—but I refuse to die a third time as a pawn in someone else’s scheme. I’m no longer the vain and naïve princess. Now that I know how the story will unfold, I’ll turn the tables around and have everyone dancing to my tune. This time, I’ll be the one pulling the strings.\n\n---\n**Original Webtoon:** [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%85%EB%85%80%EB%8A%94-%EB%A7%88%EB%A6%AC%EC%98%A4%EB%84%A4%ED%8A%B8/2464), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56422254)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* English: [Radish](https://radishfiction.com/stories/17106), [Tapas](https://tapas.io/series/the-villainess-is-a-marionette/info) [Yenpress (vol)](https://yenpress.com/series/the-villainess-is-a-marionette)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](https://www.podoteng.com/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E6%83%A1%E5%A5%B3%E6%98%AF%E6%87%B8%E7%B5%B2%E6%9C%A8%E5%81%B6/94)\n* [French / Français](https://fr.piccoma.com/fr/product/231)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/The-Villainess-is-a-Marionette/40)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/67171)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B8%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%94/117)","year":2021,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"111","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a82fe527-9e74-48d0-9c5f-a5e788c0bd4a/c62f9627-3690-47f4-b0cd-0060e379eb8b.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["id","es-la","en","fr","uk","pt-br","pl","ru","vi","mn"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.83,"follows":56007,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:22.880Z","chapters":[{"id":"d18a0993-7323-47d1-b14a-1225251aed81","number":"104","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":54,"createdAt":"2025-05-05T09:49:44+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"264ab1f1-739f-49d7-8957-85f1eb05d1ff","number":"103","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":62,"createdAt":"2025-04-07T09:12:48+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"931aa7bd-2634-406e-bd33-d5154a2a7f55","number":"102","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":52,"createdAt":"2025-03-28T12:54:44+00:00","baked":true}],"chapterCount":3,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T18:48:28.500Z"},"3d7d0879-1330-43cc-aaa4-4133933a5db5":{"id":"3d7d0879-1330-43cc-aaa4-4133933a5db5","title":"Binguihaetdeoni Goedam i Dwae Beoryeotda","altTitle":"After Transmigrating, I Became an Urban Legend","description":"I transmigrated into a romance fantasy novel.\n\nThe problem? I woke up inside a coffin… on the original owner’s funeral day.\n\nWorse, I’ve read way too many romance fantasy novels to figure out which story this is. My family is cold and heartless, and the maids tremble whenever they see me… At this rate, I must have possessed the villainess.\n\nFine. With all my rofan experience, the first thing I need to do is escape the villainess route!\n\nWhile searching for a way out, I discovered a strange symbol.\n\n“What’s this?”\n\n[How to Summon □□]\n\nA summoning circle to call a spirit? A dragon?\nPerfect. A villainess should at least have the power to protect herself.\n\n“Meow.”\n\n…But instead of a spirit or a dragon, why was I chosen by a three-eyed, leopard-spotted cheese cat?!\n\nWell, whatever. It’s adorable, so I don’t mind.\n\n⸻\n\nThere is a monster living in the Rohanson Count’s estate.\n\nA monster wearing the skin of the late Lady Evangeline.\n\nA heroine who believes the world is just a romance fantasy novel—\nAnd the people around her, forced to experience horror stories because of her.","year":2026,"status":"hiatus","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Thriller","Historical","Psychological","Romance","Comedy","Drama","Horror","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/3d7d0879-1330-43cc-aaa4-4133933a5db5/35590cbf-a484-400d-ad88-0cc05626dfc9.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","id"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":9.05,"follows":4129,"listAt":"2026-10-27T22:21:43.969Z","chapters":[{"id":"67773e63-c9a1-4875-a2ee-0e6d68858d0e","number":"30","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:40:00+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"18671fd6-f8c4-44a2-a8e1-92184c1ea9e2","number":"29","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:39:38+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"1a1dcc76-d447-4263-91e7-29cba2cc0903","number":"28","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":18,"createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:39:14+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0dcc0527-187e-4199-a6b2-21aea496c103","number":"27","volume":nu