n very conscious of how others perceive him. Yugeon, who has just moved into Lee-ahn's building, could care less about the gazes of people around him. He acts out at school and even ditches classes. When she learns of Yugeon's arrival, Lee-ahn's mother hopes that he will take care of the outsider for the sake of his reputation. Reluctantly, Lee-ahn obeys his mother. However, Yugeon realizes that Lee-ahn used him for his own image. When Yugeon threatens to tell Lee-ahn's schoolmates about it, Lee-ahn gets defensive... \"I don't care if you tell them. Just know, whatever happens next is not my responsibility.\" I was just going to end things with no regrets... Just wait! Do whatever you want!! Like a beautiful marbling that doesn't mix with water, these two create a beautiful dissonance.","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Boys' Love","Drama","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/bad92115-4108-4de1-a2af-6db815230c80/1191defb-53b6-4707-9bb5-2bb37dbf170f.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["fr","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.64,"follows":1231,"listAt":"2026-10-27T22:21:49.275Z","chapters":[{"id":"88c2802a-fe92-437e-a93a-7225cc7f4581","number":"12","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":45,"createdAt":"2023-03-29T06:43:52+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"fa10df2a-9730-4247-97d7-833135a0e3b3","number":"11","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":46,"createdAt":"2023-03-29T06:40:49+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"be47d1c3-1e54-4d3b-aaad-fcbec94fe313","number":"10","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":41,"createdAt":"2023-03-16T11:35:47+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5ff932fd-6248-4af2-8258-09439925aac6","number":"9","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2023-03-16T11:31:49+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"e7a6935e-e5dc-4578-975a-590dd7e57732","number":"8","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2023-